WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.850
Geez, we have the Red Devil,
the Evolved Mage--

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.480
sure feels great with two of these
famed mighty warriors on our side!

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.980
You can rest easy.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.190
I'll kill our teacher before you know it.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.950
We've come this far--don't you want
to bring in the third warrior, too?

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.330
Indeed, your odds of winning
may increase greatly with all three.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.580
Quit butting into our conversation!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.990
Aw, come on! Let me be in your party, too!

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.920
"Koro Sensei wants to join the party!"

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.800
But we're discussing how to kill you.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.260
Itona, the Silver Berserker, huh?

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.880
Wonder what he's like?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.880
Then how about we gather intel
on Itona for today's lesson?

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.140
There's no need.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:39.890
Huh?

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.810
"Effort" "Talent" "Victory"

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.330
I'm strong.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.270
Stronger than that classroom wall!

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.520
We've got us a real handful!

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:06.670
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:16.090
"Nagisa"

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:17.760
"Karma"

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:18.760
"Kaede"

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:20.100
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.770
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.270
"Chiba" "Hayami"

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:25.770
"Hinata" "Meg"

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:28.270
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.270
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.270
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:34.280
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.580
"The Silver Berserker"

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.050
Sorry to startle you.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:59.640
I've brought you
the Silver Berserker you were after.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.510
But now...

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.220
...he's a brand-new Big Bad, born again

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:04.970
for the express purpose of killing you.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:06.930
I-I-It's <i>you</i>!

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.600
--Hello, Koro Sensei.
--Yanagisawa!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.860
Hey! No! Spoiler alert!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.860
Fuwa?

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.030
I am Shiro,

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:19.990
a mage dispatched by
the Big Bad Army to dispatch the Big Bad.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.530
The Big Bad Army, after the Big Bad?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.950
The fearsome Big Bad,
possessing immense strength...

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:28.000
Now he's teaching humans.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.570
This is quite the scandal, you know.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.500
Shocker! Big Bad Beset by Babe Bungles!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.710
"Shocker!"

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.550
"Shocker!"
"Big Bad Beset by Babe Bungles!"

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.550
Boobs!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.300
So if you can see any way to a raise,
anything at all...

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.400
Betrayal!
Clandestine Confabs with Pope Asano!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.340
"Betrayal!"

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:44.010
"Betrayal!"
"Clandestine Confabs with Pope Asano!"

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.010
Stop!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.220
No pride and no shame.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:50.810
--I'm strong. I'm strong. I'm strong. 
I'm strong. I'm strong. I'm strong.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:50.810
--The Big Bad Army can't maintain
its solidarity under <i>that</i>.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.360
--That's where Itona comes in.
--I'm strong. I'm strong. I'm strong.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.940
He's been muttering something
this whole time. Is he okay?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:00.110
<i>I</i> am the strongest!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.740
Tentacles--like our teacher's?!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.040
The Silver Berserker,
pursuing ultimate strength.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:13.040
He's had the same tentacles
as the Big Bad's grafted on.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.380
Only the mightiest bear the "Big Bad" title.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:19.300
Win it off that monster
and <i>you</i> will be the Big Bad.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.510
<i>I</i> am the strongest Big Bad!

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.310
Sir!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.690
He's holding his own
against Koro Sensei's speed!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.530
All right, then, Itona. Kill him good, now.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.610
Wait, Mr. Shiro!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.160
<i>I'm</i> the one you're after!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.740
This is bad.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.370
Bad?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.580
You mean our teacher's going to lose?

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.910
No...

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.670
This is way too serious a direction
for a gag anime to be heading!

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:56.960
What are you talking about?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.670
Remember the whole concept for Koro-Q!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.090
Koro-Q!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.420
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.430
"Students On Duty"

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.430
Students On Duty!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.890
"Students On Duty"
"Kayano" "Yada"

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.760
Grow nice and big, now!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:12.310
Oh, should I water you, too, Kaede?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.310
And just why are you offering?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.730
Koro-Q!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.270
"Koro Sensei Quest

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.980
I'm better suited to be the Big Bad.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.570
I <i>am</i> the Big Bad.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.780
It seems your heart's set
on becoming the Big Bad.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.740
But as with heroes, the Big Bad, too,

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.370
must be well-informed
about a great many things.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.210
Knowledge and experience will
multiply your strength many times over.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.080
What are you trying to say?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.710
In short...

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.130
Presenting a grand and glorious debut!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.670
The E Class of Kunugigaoka Magic Academy:

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:45.260
"The First-Ever 'Who's 
Your Big Bad Now, See?'"

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.220
--"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"
--"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.890
Oh, now what is <i>this</i>?!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:51.470
The Big Bad: an entity possessing
both knowledge and experience!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.810
And the Big Bad's throne is on the line today

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.440
--as we pit these two contestants
against each other!

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:56.440
--I <i>would</i> like to visit the States...

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.400
"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.650
Now for the first stage:

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.730
Bada-bum!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:08.620
"Big Bad"

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:03.240
The Big Bad has invaded
a kingdom and found a princess.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.280
If you were the Big Bad, what would you do?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.030
Why am <i>I</i> the princess?!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.660
--H-Hey, wait! Where are you taking me?
--'Scuse us, folks. You'll be fine, Nagisa.
--It's all right. Quit whining!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:14.120
"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.160
--But it's so <i>frilly</i>!
--Your answers, please!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.540
Yes! Koro Sensei?

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.080
I'd offer waxing,
give her a massage and a manicure,

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.420
and hand her back in perfect condition.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.760
Yes! Itona?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.880
I'd prove that I'm stronger 
than the princess!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.050
You're gonna <i>fight</i> me?!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.680
You two haven't the foggiest.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.600
That's not the answer we're looking for here.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.190
Oh! The Red Devil has joined the fray!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.850
Your answer, please!

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.190
First I'd use the Big Bad Army's tech
to remove <i>that</i> once and for all,

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.280
then every day I'd--

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.320
Just what are you trying to remove?!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.820
Ten points to Karma!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.740
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.910
Justice!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.740
"Students On Duty"

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.740
Students On Duty!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.200
"Students On Duty"
"Kataoka" "Isogai"

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.210
"Bitter melon"

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.460
It's just about harvest time.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.710
And we can take as much we like!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.830
We're poor, so that'll be a big help.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.000
What flowers should we grow next?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.050
Maybe potatoes, carrots, and bok choy?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.090
Oh, and a little after that,
onions and green beans!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.220
Ooh--there's still time 
for some mustard greens!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.220
This <i>is</i> a flower garden, right?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.640
Koro-Q!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.180
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:21.650
"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.940
Now, onto the second stage!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.060
The Big Bad is an apex boss, as it were.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.860
Those at the top must keep their cool,
whatever the circumstances.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.110
No matter what happens,
don't change your expression!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.120
How do you like my bewitching bod?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.790
Why am <i>I</i> part of this?!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:45.050
I told you: status-effect magic
doesn't work on me.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.760
It's working now!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.840
This one's got his eyes
on the Big Bad prize, all right--

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.100
he's totally unfazed!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.310
Another hopeless case!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.520
Use these...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.520
...my brother.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.520
<i>You</i> get out of here!

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.060
No points for anyone...

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.480
Koro-Q!

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.150
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.150
"Students On Duty"

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.150
Students On Duty!

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.610
"Students On Duty"
"Hazama" "Fuwa"

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:15.030
So the whole angle
for this mini-segment here...

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.040
It was really always for Isogai, wasn't it.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.500
What are you saying?

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.910
Koro-Q!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.460
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:25.250
And so the bitter battle
to crown the next Big Bad roared on.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:28.210
What's the only thing
the Big Bad must beware?

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.260
Monster parents!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.430
The Big Bad is brutal, indeed!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.220
Give us your best, Big-Baddest blurb!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.260
Pathetic!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.020
"Forever Flat"

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.810
You are far too weak!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.270
How so?!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:57.990
"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.780
At last, the final stage!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.570
We finish with the
No-Tears-Allowed Scary-Face Faceoff!

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:55.070
Here's where we see who can
make the most Big-Bad-esque face,

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:58.330
a vicious visage that'd frighten anyone!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:03.830
Itona... why don't you join
the E Class once this match is over?

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.500
Yeah, right.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.960
I'll defeat you right here
to become the mightiest Big Bad.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:14.050
I've lived a little longer than you,
and come to know a little more.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:17.430
If you don't take that from me...

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.970
...you'll never be able to beat me!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:23.190
I won't? I...

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.520
"Who's Your Big Bad Now, See?"

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:26.230
Okay, let's begin! Ready, and...

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.020
--Go!
--Go!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.240
<i>I'm</i> the Big Bad!

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.530
I'll put a curse on you!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.870
A match like this? Practically made for me.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.500
A-And the winner is Hazama!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.460
Well, she <i>was</i> the scariest.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.630
And in a sense, the party member
you'd least want as an enemy.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:55.840
Too bad, sir. And after
you were trying so hard to look cool.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:09:00.600
--You'll never be able to beat me!
--Stop that!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.310
Pretty uncool there, Koro Sensei.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.600
So does a Big Bad need humor, too?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.020
Eh?

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.190
--Wha-a-at?!
--Wha-a-at?!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.820
<i>Wha-a-at</i>?!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.530
--I'm out!
--Huh? Oh! Wait, Itona!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.410
Can you just pull those out like that?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.200
Hey, Itona! Wait! Wait up!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:25.210
--W-W-W-W-Waaait!
--Well, shall we tidy up, then?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.920
Yes, Mistress Big Bad!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:32.800
"The next day"

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:33.090
Whatever happened to Itona, sir?

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.970
I invited him to join our class, but...

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.720
I was so sure having all three warriors
would give us a battle boost.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.180
"Effort" "Talent" "Victory"

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.310
Oh! Itona!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.560
Shiro kicked me out
after I pulled out my tentacles.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.900
Since I'm out of options, I'll brush up
on my humor here in this classroom.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:58.360
"Effort" "Talent" "Victory"

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.570
That'll be my shtick instead of saying hello.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.320
What a handful...

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.570
"Itona joined the party!"
